OL,3,CMultiple homes seriously damaged after
OL,4,Cfire spreads to properties in Crawley
OL,6,FWatch: Firefighters tackle fire
OL,7,Fspreading to properties in Crawley
OL,9,FTen properties have been affected by a
OL,10,Ffire in Crawley, with four homes
OL,11,Fdestroyed.
OL,13,FThe alarm was raised in Ash Keys on
OL,14,FMonday afternoon (3 August) where
OL,15,Feight fire engines were called out.
OL,17,FThe fire also spread to gardens - with
OL,18,Fnearby residents urged to keep doors
OL,19,Fand windows closed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
