OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785863931
OL,3,CMultiple homes seriously damaged after
OL,4,Cfire spreads to properties in Crawley
OL,6,FCrews worked hard to bring the fire
OL,7,Funder control and to extinguish it.
OL,9,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service is
OL,10,Furging people to take extra
OL,11,Fprecautions as the risk of fire
OL,12,Fremains very high across the county
OL,13,Fdue to the prolonged, dry weather.
OL,15,FA spokesperson said: "We would like to
OL,16,Fuse this opportunity to remind people
OL,17,Fthat the Fire Severity Index, which
OL,18,Fmeasures how severe a fire would be if
OL,19,Fone were to break out, remains very
OL,20,Fhigh in West Sussex due to the
OL,21,Fprolonged warm, dry weather."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
