OL,3,CMultiple homes seriously damaged after
OL,4,Cfire spreads to properties in Crawley
OL,6,FFirefighters are encouraging people to
OL,7,Favoid using disposable barbecues and
OL,8,Fhaving bonfires in outdoor spaces,
OL,10,FThey are also urging people to pick up
OL,11,Flitter, extinguish smoking materials
OL,12,Fproperly, and to report any signs of
OL,13,Ffire by calling 999 straight away.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/3
